  "question": {
    "text": "Number of words that can be formed with the letters of the word <math><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></math> so that all the vowels are separated (or no two vowels come together) is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>720</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2160</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1440</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1200</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Vowels are <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>E</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>A</mi></math>  <br/>Consonants are <math><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi>X</mi><mi></mi><mi>L</mi><mi></mi><mi>X</mi><mi></mi><mi>G</mi><mi></mi><mi>X</mi><mi></mi><mi>B</mi><mi></mi><mi>X</mi><mi></mi><mi>R</mi><mi></mi><mi>X</mi></math>  <br/>Since there is no restriction on consonants, we must place them first and they can be arranged in <math><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math> days. <br/>Now to arrange vowels so that no two of them are together we have <math><mn>5</mn></math> places <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Out of these <math><mn>5</mn></math> places, <math><mn>3</mn></math> can be selected in <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> ways and then one arrangement can be made in <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> ways. <br/>Thus, required ways <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>720</mn></math>"
  }
}